20
00:02:02.335 --> 00:02:06.072
from my bedroom. "I think you should read this," I told him and handed over the book. I

21
00:02:06.073 --> 00:02:09.390
left the professor to read and went upstairs to check on Mina. "I understand now what happened to Lucy,"

22
00:02:09.391 --> 00:02:16.437
