00:02:43.612 --> 00:02:49.151
them. The soil in the coffins on that ship belonged to the count. He must have sustained himself on

28
00:02:49.152 --> 00:02:55.334
the long voyage to England by feeding on the captain and crew. Van Helsing believes that the black

29
00:02:55.335 --> 00:03:01.103
dog that was found on the ship that morning may have been the count in disguise. Mina, Count Dracula

30
00:03:01.104 --> 00:03:08.055
killed your best friend, and we must stop him from striking again!" By the time I returned downstairs, our

31
