00:04:02.508 --> 00:04:07.095
idea─Jonathan, did you find out where his coffins are located?" "Yes," I replied. "At his house here in London."

42
00:04:07.096 --> 00:04:10.341
"Great. Well, vampires also fear anything that has been blessed by the church. If we can get into his

43
