he has returned to his casket, we will sneak into his house again and put a stake through his

47
00:04:43.096 --> 00:04:44.651
heart, killing him at last. Are you gentlemen ready?" We gathered our things and left Mina at the house─I

48
00:04:44.652 --> 00:04:50.841
did not want her risking her life by joining us. We filled up several bottles with holy water at

49
00:04:50.842 --> 00:04:57.611
the local parish and then made our way by coach to the count’s house. We waited until the sun

50
00:04:57.612 --> 00:05:05.174
had set and then scaled the high stone walls and crept quietly across the lawn toward the cellar doors.

51
00:05:05.175 --> 00:05:11.968
The professor guessed that the count’s coffins would be stored in the basement, where they would be the

52
