had not yet finished. Just then, the professor let out a cry and announced, "It’s too late! He’s coming!

57
00:05:51.104 --> 00:05:57.865
The count is coming!" We looked up toward the entrance and saw the count come through the door like

58
00:05:57.866 --> 00:06:07.635
a cloud of black smoke. When he realized we were there, his face turned hard and angry and he

59
00:06:07.636 --> 00:06:10.087
bared his sharp, white teeth. We thought we were facing certain death, and then, in a bizarre twist

60
00:06:10.088 --> 00:06:14.428
of fate, he looked me directly in the eyes, turned around, and ran back up the stairs. I thought

61
00:06:14.429 --> 00:06:24.991
I saw a challenge in his look. "Mina!" I yelled. "He’s going after Mina!" At breakneck speed, we hurried

62
00:06:24.992 --> 00:06:29.674
back to the house and were terrified to find that the front door was open and a trail of

63
00:06:29.675 --> 00:06:35.126
what looked like muddy animal tracks led up to the bedroom. I ran up the stairs and banged on

64
00:06:35.127 --> 00:06:43.094
the locked door with both fists. "Help me!" I called down to my colleagues, and together, we broke down

65
00:06:43.095 --> 00:06:47.301
